00:09:30.689 --> 00:09:34.529
same procedure gave different results on
different people there are lots of

00:09:34.529 --> 00:09:38.699
reasons this could be the case you might
have different bacteria on your skin a

00:09:38.699 --> 00:09:42.660
different skin microbiome you might have
different activity levels you might get

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:45.480
